		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Blender 2.42 preview 11]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=895#p895"><![CDATA[
Here is a new Blender 2.42 Windows preview Build, number 11.<br><br>- collision sensor support ('triggers')<br>- ghost / trigger rigidbody support (collision detection but no contact response)<br>- several other Bullet fixes / improvements in collision detection and constraint solver<br>- vehicle demo (raycast vehicle)<br><br>Blender executable:<br><a href="http://www.continuousphysics.com/ftp/pub/test/index.php?dir=blender/&amp;file=blender-2.42preview11.zip" class="postlink">http://www.continuousphysics.com/ftp/pu ... view11.zip</a><br><br>Physics Demos:<br><a href="http://www.continuousphysics.com/ftp/pub/test/index.php?dir=blender/&amp;file=physics-demos-2.42-preview11.zip" class="postlink">http://www.continuousphysics.com/ftp/pu ... view11.zip</a><br><br>Graphics Demo:<br><a href="http://www.continuousphysics.com/ftp/pub/test/index.php?dir=blender/&amp;file=parallaxbumpmap_CVS_Build-preview7.zip" class="postlink">http://www.continuousphysics.com/ftp/pu ... eview7.zip</a><br>Graphics Docs:<br>http://snailrose_dir.home.bresnan.net/<br><br>Erwin<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=2">Erwin Coumans</a> — Mon Apr 17, 2006 6:50 am</p><hr />
